@startuml
' Legacy activity syntax: (*) start/end, quoted activities, arrows with [labels]
(*) --> "Open login page"
--> "Enter credentials" as creds
note right: at most 3 attempts
if "Credentials valid?" then
  -->[yes] "Load profile"
  -right-> "Show dashboard"
  --> (*)
else
  ->[no] "Show error"
  -->[retry] creds
endif
partition Audit {
  "Show error" --> "Log failed attempt"
}
"Log failed attempt" --> ===B1===
===B1=== --> "Notify security"
"Notify security" --> (*)
@enduml
